<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-050-B habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.278227" lon="-120.913049"><name>SC26-050-B</name><desc>Avila rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 7.8 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 72/100; not catch probability. Center 108 ft; nearby 105–134 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KBGELE"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-033</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.281334455524224" lon="-120.9129138822104"/><trkpt lat="35.28088390437235" lon="-120.91292544765187"/><trkpt lat="35.280899074809064" lon="-120.91380457584162"/><trkpt lat="35.28126141181563" lon="-120.9139052189556"/><trkpt lat="35.281267098859985" lon="-120.91423489368577"/><trkpt lat="35.28074728141329" lon="-120.91545756347962"/><trkpt lat="35.279773112039024" lon="-120.91647198272318"/><trkpt lat="35.27905790804872" lon="-120.91682012102703"/><trkpt lat="35.278248806598675" lon="-120.91695078564258"/><trkpt lat="35.276799466241876" lon="-120.91654817542988"/><trkpt lat="35.275791208192956" lon="-120.91558461149643"/><trkpt lat="35.27513390903823" lon="-120.9140624118794"/><trkpt lat="35.27510167276756" lon="-120.91219439734131"/><trkpt lat="35.27527050885809" lon="-120.91153047056586"/><trkpt lat="35.275811170256986" lon="-120.91151658561434"/><trkpt lat="35.27580547656602" lon="-120.91118693356579"/><trkpt lat="35.27553134967508" lon="-120.91097410992991"/><trkpt lat="35.27614693169031